The '''Commune of Castejón''' is the central [[Communes of Balisca|commune]] of the [[Castejón|Castejón Metropolis]], roughly correlating to the northwestern half of the [[Ampurias]] borough. It is also known as ''Ciudad Vieja/Siudað Biḷa'' ("Old City") in order to differentiate it from the wider metropolis.   

